### 📁 `.gitignore`
```gitignore

# cluster outputs
data/
results/
*.log
*.out

*.pyc

# Byte-compiled / cache
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.Rhistory
*.RData
*.Rproj.user

# Jupyter Notebook checkpoints
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# Data files
data/*.nc
data/*.csv
*.h5
*.zip

# PyCharm & system
.idea/
.DS_Store
.env
.env.*


data/bootstrap_smmr/*.nc
data/
results/
*.log
*.out
__pycache__/
*.pyc
